{
  "item": "goblinmaster",
  "mu_name": "Seed Master",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/goblinmaster.bmd, loaded as MODEL_SEED_MASTER (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2105, its textures out of Npc\\), MuMain's MONSTER_SEED_MASTER, whose ID is the Korean for 'Seed Master' (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14748-14754). Type 452, OpenMU's 'Seed Master' (VersionSeasonSix/NpcInitialization.cs:614-619), Season 4's socket NPC in Elbeland (Maps/Elvenland.cs:55). Not Version075's.",
  "world": "aida",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "Aida's quest giver, the user's pick (2026-10-16: 'goblinmaster.bmd will work', from four goblin models in Data/NPC; docs/game/aida-quest.md). An old goblin sage with long ears, a white beard and a red and blue robe, holding a staff: 1308 triangles on two sheets, 114 bones, four clips.",
  "scale_from": "CreateCharacter stands him at `c->Object.Scale = 1.1f` with m_fEdgeScale 1.2 (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14751-14752), MU's own and not this mesh's: whoever stands him owes the 1.1, as a placement's scale. No lift, no BlendMesh, no subtype.",
  "actions_from": "Four clips, all kept (export-rig --actions=all): action 0 twelve keys, 1 twenty-one, 2 twenty-two, 3 twenty-seven. MoveCharacter's MODEL_SEED_MASTER case (ZzzCharacter.cpp:3594-3600) plays action 0 two times in three or while another clip runs, else one of 1-3 at random.",
  "effects_from": "RenderCharacter's MODEL_SEED_MASTER case (ZzzCharacter.cpp:11346-11354): a BITMAP_FLARE at scale 2 on bone 39, its light (sin(WorldTime/1000)+1)*0.3+0.4 a channel times 0.5, a slow white pulse. Not drawn yet: owed.",
  "profile": "npc",
  "sheets": {
    "goblinmaster": "npc_goblinmaster.png",
    "gbarbard": "npc_gbarbard.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Out of Data/NPC, beside the model, decoded under an npc_ prefix: goblinmaster.OZJ (256x256, opaque) and gbarbard.OZT (64x128, its alpha cuts away 45%).",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "goblinmaster": "skin",
    "gbarbard": "hair"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "goblinmaster is one page carrying his green skin, robe, trim and staff together, so skin, as every townsperson's shared page does; gbarbard is his beard, a card of white strands, hair.",
